{"name": "Diggin", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"405\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/cfa3de9fbe11a6ec17877bdba27ed263.avif?t=1786699883\" width=\"1260\"/></span>You are Doug, a mischievous young Mole set on conquering the strange meteoric crater discovered by your Grandpa Digby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"376\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/9cac6e02573636e6575300e19d5c47b1.poster.avif?t=1786699883\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/9cac6e02573636e6575300e19d5c47b1.webm?t=1786699883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/9cac6e02573636e6575300e19d5c47b1.mp4?t=1786699883\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the crater's materials to upgrade your drill, transform the ground and get more mining gear in the <strong>GIANT\u00a0</strong>skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"376\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/45c3a1399e2955b4b8c2f36107128985.poster.avif?t=1786699883\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/45c3a1399e2955b4b8c2f36107128985.webm?t=1786699883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/45c3a1399e2955b4b8c2f36107128985.mp4?t=1786699883\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The crater is the last known location of an ancient star-nosed tribe of Moles that vanished completely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"376\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/a23302c415dfbb6cde6882b7100e38a8.poster.avif?t=1786699883\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/a23302c415dfbb6cde6882b7100e38a8.webm?t=1786699883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/a23302c415dfbb6cde6882b7100e38a8.mp4?t=1786699883\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The earth holds bountiful ores, relics and secrets of the lost tribe, and <strong>it's up to you to dig them up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/extras/eee645f63d1cf6b5383c8c15c3ad2d40.avif?t=1786699883\" width=\"1260\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Drill into the depths of a meteor crater in this incremental adventure. Mine ores, unlock upgrades and find the cosmic treasure that lies below! Can you uncover what happened to the Moles that came before you?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157430/28fe6101fee318ba4db6654ba8d9656b011828fd/header.jpg?t=1786699883", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Incremental", "Exploration", "Management", "Mining", "Idler", "Strategy"], "developers": "Longshot Studio", "publishers": "Longshot Studio", "release_date": "Jul 16, 2026", "price": "$4.89", "appid": "4157430", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/UnPIWClqdbE", "first_seen": 1769209200.0, "review_rank": 1347}